Built-in commands (`help NAME` shows more about one):

  .                 Run the commands in a file in the current shell.
true

Do nothing, successfully (exit status 0).

`true` ignores its arguments.

false

Do nothing, unsuccessfully (exit status 1).

`false` ignores its arguments.
status 0
true

Do nothing, successfully (exit status 0).

`true` ignores its arguments.
status 1
